(mount(2) requires CAP_SYS_ADMIN/root, so this is NOT auto-run in CI -)
(deliberately no .expected file, so test.sh skips it.)
(Run manually with: sudo ./target/release/vox tests/manual_mount_bind_and_move.vox --run)
(This exercises the exact bind+move pattern the initramfs pivot_root sequence needs.)

Remove the directory called "/tmp/vox_test_mount_source".
Remove the directory called "/tmp/vox_test_mount_bind".
Remove the directory called "/tmp/vox_test_mount_moved".
Create a directory called "/tmp/vox_test_mount_source".
Create a directory called "/tmp/vox_test_mount_bind".
Create a directory called "/tmp/vox_test_mount_moved".

Mount "/tmp/vox_test_mount_source" at "/tmp/vox_test_mount_bind" with type "none" with options "bind".
On error print "bind mount failed - are you root?", exit 1.
Print "bind mount succeeded".

Mount "/tmp/vox_test_mount_bind" at "/tmp/vox_test_mount_moved" with type "none" with options "move".
On error print "move mount failed", exit 1.
Print "move mount succeeded".

(NOTE: Vox has no umount statement yet, so this deliberately leaves the)
(mount active. Clean up manually: sudo umount /tmp/vox_test_mount_moved)
